    "summary": "A wool rug, a kilim.  Three large, composite diamond motifs worked in tapestry technique in a vertical line in the centre of the rug, using natural cream, red, yellow, dark blue, green, orange and grey/blue woollen yarns.  Red, grey, blue and green wool bands towards each warp end.  Some yarns unevenly dyed.  Some damage to cream wool plaited warp.  Plaited fringe replaced by four whipped tassels in some areas: wrapped with pink and blue silk (?) thread and additional red silk thread in tassel.  One hole, repaired, near one warp end.",
